     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>I am trying to use fileInput, and I want to be able to load files with it repeatedly.</div><div><br></div><div>in ui.R I have:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#000\">fileInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;uploadfile&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Upload File&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font></div></div></code></div><br>then in server.R:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#000\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span></font></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#000\">  input$uploadfile<br> isolate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">do</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stuff </span><span style=\"color:#008\">with</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> the uploaded file </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> now would like to update input$uploadfile so </span><span style=\"color:#008\">next</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> time I press the fileInput button</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">this</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> observe code will be executed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br></span></div></div></code></div><br>The code inside the observe works once, but then never again.</div><div><br></div><div>I have seen threads that refer to calls like:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div>            session$sendCustomMessage(type = &quot;resetFileInputHandler&quot;, &quot;file1&quot;)</div></div></code></div><div><br></div>and I have tried this, but this doesn&#39;t seem to reset input$uploadfile.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Sorry! I must be missing something obvious.  Repeated uploading must be possible somehow.</div><div>Thanks for any help.</div></div>"
